Photonscore LINCam ".photons" (D7) reader
  modules/io/ps/include/PhotonscoreD7.h, modules/io/ps/src/PhotonscoreD7.cpp
  are a modified, std-only C++ port of:

  - D7 (.photons) file format reference implementation
    https://github.com/photonscore/d7
    Copyright 2026 Photonscore GmbH
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
    (licenses/Apache-2.0.txt). The attribution notice of its NOTICE file
    that pertains to this port is reproduced here:

        D7 (.photons) file format reference implementation
        Copyright 2026 Photonscore GmbH

    (The third-party components that NOTICE also lists -- fmt, oneTBB,
    protobuf -- are not used by or included in tttrlib.)

  - photonsfile, a pure-Python reader for Photonscore LINCam .photons files
    https://github.com/alex1075/photonsfile
    Copyright (c) 2026 Alex Hunt
    MIT License (licenses/photonsfile-MIT.txt)

  The tttrlib developers modified the code: the decoder was rewritten in
  C++ (standard library only, protobuf wire format parsed by hand), only
  the integer delta-encoded datasets are decoded, and it was adapted to
  tttrlib's file I/O and TTTR container. tttrlib's modifications are
  licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License.
